<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Measuring Scalar Constructs in Social Science with LLMs
<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>Accepted to EMNLP 2025 (Main)</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
